<map>
	<name>Event La Gleize </name>
	<briefing locid="Battle of the Bulge, December 1944, La Gleize, Belgium. The village is thrust into the conflict as the spearhead of the German offensive led by 1.SS Panzer-Division faces American forces deployed around the area, including the 3rd Armored Division, infantry from the 30th Division, and paratroopers from the 82nd Airborne Division.
	
The village endured heavy bombardment, and on Christmas Eve, surrounded German forces fled, leaving behind 135 armored vehicles. While Bastogne symbolizes American resilience, La Gleize represents the German setback.">map description for modders maps not localized (english only)</briefing>
	<music> common/sound/menu/music/blitz.ogg </music>
